# ADR 0038: Open to LAN with singleplayer's server on the page. A page can't listen for
# connections, so the game says it couldn't host instead of failing. (With the server in a worker,
# the pause menu has no World Options yet: ADR 0039.) Positions are for the 1280x577 viewport.
#
#   ./gradlew :app-web:browserCheck -Pbrowser.gpu=gl -Pbrowser.seconds=300 "-Pbrowser.query=name=Player&singleplayer=page" \
#       -Pbrowser.steps=@browser-checks/singleplayer-lan.steps

